  "prefLabel": "Env-C 211.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 211.01 Purpose. The rules in this part are intended to clarify the procedures by which a person can apply to the department for a determination under RSA 72:12-a.\n\nSource. #8851-B, eff 3-25-07; ss by #10802-B, eff 3-24-15",
